<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
following tables summarize certain financial data regarding our business and should be read in conjunction with our financial statements
and related notes contained elsewhere in this prospectus and the information under &ldquo;<I>Management&rsquo;s Discussion and Analysis
of Financial Condition and Results of Operations</I>.&rdquo;</FONT></P>

