</TR>
<TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(3)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Our board of directors determined it was in the best
                                            interest of the Company and its stockholders to grant Sean Dollinger an award of 1,000,000
                                            RSUs, under the Company&rsquo;s 2021 Plan, to compensate him for his employment with the
                                            Company. Mr.&nbsp;Dollinger was granted an award of 1,000,000 RSUs under the Company&rsquo;s
                                            2021 Plan, with one (1)&nbsp;RSU corresponding to one (1)&nbsp;share of Common Stock. The
                                            RSUs will only start vesting once the 2021 Plan has been amended to increase the number of
                                            shares reserved under the 2021 Plan to cover the issuance of the shares of Common Stock underlying
                                            the RSUs. Accordingly, these 1,000,000 RSUs are not reflected in this table.</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

